 "intro": {
  "@es": "Hay frases que mezclan dos tiempos: lo que no pasó en el pasado y su efecto en el presente. Y «come se» (como si) lleva congiuntivo imperfetto.",
  "@en": "There are phrases that mix two times: what did not happen in the past and its effect in the present. And «come se» (as if) has an imperfect congiuntive."
 }
